        {
          "id": 709440148,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "BTW, the variable where *pui8 is stored (guint8 Exist_DownlinkDualCarrierCapability_r7) is marked as guint8 like all of the Exist variables, but should be actually considered a bool, so only checked against zero or different than 0 I'd say, so it shouldn't matter anyway. What I mean is, the stored variable is not a counter.",
          "author": {
            "id": 3212477,
            "username": "pespin",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "pespin.shar@gmail.com",
